    "4e68093b-95cb-4e22-9c0b-8a1da58c78e7": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "ELECTRA",
        "title": "Why was this collection created?",
        "title_size": 28,
        "title_width": 12,
        "text": "<p>Medical facilities—such as intensive care units, imaging rooms, and operating theatres—require careful design to prevent electrostatic buildup. Uncontrolled static discharge can cause mild electric shocks to patients and healthcare professionals, interfere with sensitive medical equipment, and pose risks to both people and devices.</p><p></p><p><strong>ELECTRA</strong> was engineered specifically to meet this challenge. </p><p>Using state-of-the-art chemical functionalization for conductivity, this innovative upholstery fabric safely channels static electricity away, preventing electric shocks. It combines safety with comfort and hygiene —allowing medical professionals and patients to sit or lie down with confidence.</p>",
        "button_label": "ORDER FREE SAMPLES",
        "button_link": "shopify://products/electra-collection",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "text_width": 62,
        "button_style": "primary",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/electra_chair6.png",
        "image_width": 80,
        "image_position": "left",
        "media_size": "cover",
        "color_scheme": "standard",
        "color_bg": "",
        "color_text": ""
      }
    },
    "image_with_text_Dnqd84": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "name": "Media with text",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "Key Features",
        "title_size": 28,
        "title_width": 12,
        "text": "<p><strong>ELECTRA</strong> is a permanently antistatic fabric designed to enhance safety by preventing electric shocks and protecting sensitive medical equipment.</p><p>Conductive properties are stable and independent of humidity. Specifically developed for healthcare environments, its surface is treated to <strong>inhibit microbial growth and resist staining from bodily fluids.</strong></p><p><strong>Antistatic fabrics</strong> are easier to clean and disinfect, supporting a more hygienic and safer environment.Their resistance to dust and particle accumulation helps keep surfaces <strong>cleaner for longer</strong>, reducing the need for frequent maintenance.<br/><br/></p>",
        "button_label": "DOWNLOAD TECHNICAL FILE",
        "button_link": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0711/9801/5791/files/TF_Electra.pdf?v=1774377653",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "text_width": 50,
