    "image_with_text_rGPpGp": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "name": "Media with text",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "Bi-elastic comfort and weldable precision",
        "title_size": 28,
        "title_width": 12,
        "text": "<p>The <strong>bi-directional elasticity</strong> of ELECTRA gently follows every curve of the body and every contour of the furniture, enhancing seating and lying comfort while making complex upholstery shapes easier to achieve. This flexibility reduces tension on seams and stress points, helping pieces look smooth, supportive, and inviting even after intensive use.</p><p>At the same time, its thermoplastic coating unlocks weldable precision: adjacent materials can be securely joined through heat welding, simplifying the assembly process, improving seam durability, and ensuring a clean, clinical finish with fewer potential points of failure. For healthcare teams and manufacturers, this means faster, more reliable fabrication—and for patients, it means safer, more comfortable surfaces they can truly trust.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "text_width": 50,
        "button_style": "auto",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/bielastic-coated-fabrics1.png",
        "image_width": 80,
        "image_position": "right",
        "media_size": "contain",
        "color_scheme": "standard",
        "color_bg": "",
        "color_text": ""
      }
    },
    "7ac6aad9-7211-4cdf-948d-944d479ad3c8": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "Biocompatibility",
        "title_size": 28,
        "title_width": 12,
        "text": "<p>ELCTRA seamlessly and safely interacts with living tissues, without triggering adverse reactions or toxic effects on cells, as demonstrated by its non-irritating and non-cytotoxic characteristics in accordance with <strong>ISO standards: ISO 10993-5 and ISO 10993-10</strong>. This ensures a dependable and comfortable experience in healthcare environments, where patient well-being is paramount.<br/></p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "text_width": 50,
        "button_style": "link",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/dentist-chair-upholstery-fabrics.jpg",
        "image_width": 83,
        "image_position": "left",
        "media_size": "cover",
        "color_scheme": "standard",
        "color_bg": "",
        "color_text": ""
      }
    },
